eral law  states I was raised by my grandparents  so the idea of grandparents not being  part of a family is very foreign to me  last night Hawaii asked a district judge  to stop enforcing the ban and a more  clearly explained what makes a bona fide  relationship civil liberties groups say  they are anticipating further legal  challenges we feel like we're gonna keep  winning to be missed and we're not gonna  get sick of waiting there are other  exceptions to the executive order that  includes people with direct business  ties to the US journalists adopted  children and people seeking urgent  medical attention here in the US the  Supreme Court is set to hear arguments  on this new executive order in the fall  David thank you Chris
 

